    <string name="smart_link_tip_title">Important Notes</string>
    <string name="smart_link_tip_body">1. The first time you enable this feature, manually search for the Bluetooth device whose model name is the prefix and whose name ends with “Smart”, then pair and connect before use.\n2. After the “Smart” Bluetooth device is connected, regular radio intercom functions will be disabled.\n3. To switch back to normal intercom, disconnect the “Smart” device, turn off SmartLink, or turn off Bluetooth.\n4. When using TTotalk PTT Walkie Talkie app, or Nanshan Intercom, set the PTT mode to “Other 1” or “Other 2”.</string>
