    <string name="smart_link_reading">Reading...</string>
    <string name="smart_link_compatibility_title">Compatibility Notes</string>
    <string name="smart_link_compatibility_body">Because of OS and third-party app limitations, note the following differences:\n\niOS: Zello and Jiutao Talk are not currently supported. Siri continuous conversation requires iOS 18 or later.\nHarmonyOS: Custom “hold-to-talk” is not currently supported.\nMedia conflicts: Music or video playback may cause the Bluetooth key to stop working. If this happens, return to the talk app and hold the on-screen PTT manually, or play one voice message to reactivate it.\n\nTip: This feature has been adapted for mainstream hardware and software environments. Because operating system ecosystems are complex and third-party apps continue to change, not all historical versions or future changes can be fully covered.</string>
